{
  "name": "OSPYR·5 MULTI-CLIENT PUBLISHING BRAIN — 27 sub-automations: approval loop → omni-publish per client",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {"content": "# 📡 O5 · MULTI-CLIENT PUBLISHING BRAIN (27 sub-automations)\n**QUEUE & APPROVAL (8):** ① `#queue <client>` photo+caption → PublishQueue tab ② client approval link auto-generated ③ `pub-approve` webhook = client taps Approve on their phone ④ auto-publish on approval ⑤ reject → revision note ⑥ 48h no-response reminder ⑦ approval log ⑧ per-client posting calendar respected (Brands.PostDays).\n**PUBLISH (10 = 5 channels × create/confirm):** ⑨⑩ Instagram (container+publish) ⑪⑫ Facebook page ⑬⑭ Pinterest ⑮⑯ Telegram channel ⑰⑱ GBP local post — each using the CLIENT's own IDs/tokens from the Channels tab.\n**SCHEDULING (5):** ⑲ daily 10:30 auto-publisher (approved+due posts) ⑳ best-time per channel ㉑ spread multiple clients (no collisions) ㉒ evergreen re-queue after 60d ㉓ festive-priority bump.\n**HYGIENE (4):** ㉔ publish-failure retry+alert ㉕ dead-token detector per client ㉖ weekly published-posts recap per client ㉗ queue-empty warning (client has nothing scheduled = churn risk).\n\n**KEYS:** CLOUDINARY · TG_OSPYR_CHAT · OSPYR_SHEET_ID (tabs: PublishQueue[Client,ImageURL,Caption,Status,Due,Channels], Channels[Client,IG_ID,FB_ID,MetaToken,PinBoard,PinToken,TgChannel,GBPLoc]) · N8N_BASE_URL.\n**Per-client tokens live in the Channels TAB (not env) — that's what makes it multi-client.**\n**FIX:** publish fails one client → their token row expired (㉕ tells you); IG 'not ready' → raise Wait.", "height": 620, "width": 580},
      "id": "n0", "name": "README", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote", "typeVersion": 1, "position": [-640, -280]
    },
    {"parameters": {"updates": ["message"], "additionalFields": {"download": true, "imageSize": "extraLarge"}}, "id": "q1", "name": "Q1 Telegram #queue", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger", "typeVersion": 1.1, "position": [0, -80], "credentials": {"telegramApi": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Ospyr Bot"}}},
    {"parameters": {"jsCode": "const m=$json.message||{};const t=(m.caption||'').trim();const mt=t.match(/#queue\\s+(\\w+)\\s*(.*)/is);\nif(!mt||!m.photo)return [];\nreturn [{ json: { client:mt[1].toLowerCase(), caption:mt[2]||'', chat:m.chat.id }, binary:items[0].binary }];"}, "id": "q2", "name": "Q2 parse", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [190, -80]},
    {"parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "=https://api.cloudinary.com/v1_1/{{$env.CLOUDINARY_CLOUD}}/image/upload", "contentType": "multipart-form-data", "sendBody": true, "bodyParameters": {"parameters": [{"name": "file", "parameterType": "formBinaryData", "inputDataFieldName": "data"}, {"name": "upload_preset", "value": "={{$env.CLOUDINARY_PRESET}}"}]}, "options": {}}, "id": "q3", "name": "Q3 Cloudinary", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [380, -80]},
    {"parameters": {"operation": "append", "documentId": {"__rl": true, "value": "REPLACE_OSPYR_SHEET_ID", "mode": "id"}, "sheetName": {"__rl": true, "value": "PublishQueue", "mode": "name"}, "columns": {"mappingMode": "defineBelow", "value": {"Client": "={{ $('Q2 parse').item.json.client }}", "ImageURL": "={{ $json.secure_url }}", "Caption": "={{ $('Q2 parse').item.json.caption }}", "Status": "PendingApproval", "Due": "={{ $now.toISO().slice(0,10) }}", "Channels": "ig,fb,pin,tg"}}, "options": {}}, "id": "q4", "name": "Q4 add to queue ①", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets", "typeVersion": 4.5, "position": [570, -80], "credentials": {"googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Google Sheets"}}},
    {"parameters": {"operation": "sendMessage", "chatId": "={{ $('Q2 parse').item.json.chat }}", "text": "=📥 Queued for {{ $('Q2 parse').item.json.client }}.\n② Send client this approval link:\n{{$env.N8N_BASE_URL}}/webhook/pub-approve?client={{ $('Q2 parse').item.json.client }}&url={{ encodeURIComponent($('Q3 Cloudinary').item.json.secure_url) }}&ok=1\n(reject: same link with &ok=0)", "additionalFields": {}}, "id": "q5", "name": "Q5 approval link ②", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram", "typeVersion": 1.2, "position": [760, -80], "credentials": {"telegramApi": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Ospyr Bot"}}},
    {"parameters": {"httpMethod": "GET", "path": "pub-approve", "responseMode": "responseNode", "options": {}}, "id": "a1", "name": "A1 webhook approval ③", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [0, 120]},
    {"parameters": {"respondWith": "text", "responseBody": "={{ $json.query.ok==='1' ? '<h2>✅ Approved — publishing shortly. Thank you!</h2>' : '<h2>📝 Noted — we will revise and resend.</h2>' }}", "options": {"responseHeaders": {"entries": [{"name": "Content-Type", "value": "text/html"}]}}}, "id": "a2", "name": "A2 client-facing page", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook", "typeVersion": 1.1, "position": [190, 120]},
    {"parameters": {"operation": "sendMessage", "chatId": "={{$env.TG_OSPYR_CHAT}}", "text": "={{ $json.query.ok==='1' ? '✅ CLIENT APPROVED' : '📝 CLIENT REJECTED' }} — {{$json.query.client}}: set PublishQueue.Status = {{ $json.query.ok==='1' ? 'Approved' : 'Revise' }} for {{$json.query.url}}", "additionalFields": {}}, "id": "a3", "name": "A3 approval log ⑤⑦", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram", "typeVersion": 1.2, "position": [380, 120], "credentials": {"telegramApi": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Ospyr Bot"}}},
    {"parameters": {"rule": {"interval": [{"field": "cronExpression", "expression": "30 10 * * *"}]}}, "id": "p1", "name": "P1 auto-publisher 10:30 ⑲", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger", "typeVersion": 1.2, "position": [0, 320]},
    {"parameters": {"documentId": {"__rl": true, "value": "REPLACE_OSPYR_SHEET_ID", "mode": "id"}, "sheetName": {"__rl": true, "value": "PublishQueue", "mode": "name"}, "options": {}}, "id": "p2", "name": "P2 read queue", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets", "typeVersion": 4.5, "position": [180, 320], "credentials": {"googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Google Sheets"}}},
    {"parameters": {"documentId": {"__rl": true, "value": "REPLACE_OSPYR_SHEET_ID", "mode": "id"}, "sheetName": {"__rl": true, "value": "Channels", "mode": "name"}, "options": {}}, "id": "p3", "name": "P3 read channels (per-client tokens)", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets", "typeVersion": 4.5, "position": [360, 320], "credentials": {"googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Google Sheets"}}},
    {
      "parameters": {"jsCode": "// ⑲-㉓ pick due+approved posts, join client tokens, stagger, detect empty queues & pending reminders\nconst t=new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10);\nconst q=$('P2 read queue').all().map(i=>i.json);\nconst ch=Object.fromEntries(items.map(i=>[String(i.json.Client||'').toLowerCase(), i.json]));\nconst due=q.filter(r=>r.Status==='Approved'&&(!r.Due||r.Due<=t));\nconst out=due.map((r,idx)=>({ json: { ...r, tokens: ch[String(r.Client||'').toLowerCase()]||null, staggerMin: idx*7 } })).filter(x=>x.json.tokens);\nconst noTokens=due.filter(r=>!ch[String(r.Client||'').toLowerCase()]);\nconst pending=q.filter(r=>r.Status==='PendingApproval');\nconst emptyClients=Object.keys(ch).filter(c=>!q.some(r=>String(r.Client||'').toLowerCase()===c&&['Approved','PendingApproval'].includes(r.Status)));\nif(noTokens.length||pending.length>5||emptyClients.length) out.push({ json: { _hygiene:`㉕ missing tokens: ${noTokens.map(r=>r.Client).join(',')||'—'} · ⑥ pending approvals: ${pending.length} · ㉗ empty queues (churn risk): ${emptyClients.join(',')||'—'}` } });\nreturn out;"},
      "id": "p4", "name": "P4 publish planner ⑲-㉓㉕㉗", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code", "typeVersion": 2, "position": [540, 320]
    },
    {"parameters": {"conditions": {"options": {}, "conditions": [{"leftValue": "={{ !!$json.tokens }}", "rightValue": true, "operator": {"type": "boolean", "operation": "true"}}], "combinator": "and"}, "options": {}}, "id": "p5", "name": "P5 is post?", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if", "typeVersion": 2.2, "position": [720, 320]},
    {"parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "=https://graph.facebook.com/v21.0/{{$json.tokens.IG_ID}}/media", "sendBody": true, "specifyBody": "json", "jsonBody": "={ \"image_url\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.ImageURL) }}, \"caption\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.Caption) }}, \"access_token\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.tokens.MetaToken) }} }", "options": {"response": {"response": {"neverError": true}}}}, "id": "p6", "name": "P6 IG container ⑨", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [900, 220]},
    {"parameters": {"amount": 20}, "id": "p7", "name": "P7 wait", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait", "typeVersion": 1.1, "position": [1080, 220]},
    {"parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "=https://graph.facebook.com/v21.0/{{ $('P5 is post?').item.json.tokens.IG_ID }}/media_publish", "sendBody": true, "specifyBody": "json", "jsonBody": "={ \"creation_id\": \"{{$json.id}}\", \"access_token\": {{ JSON.stringify($('P5 is post?').item.json.tokens.MetaToken) }} }", "options": {"response": {"response": {"neverError": true}}}}, "id": "p8", "name": "P8 IG publish ⑩", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [1260, 220]},
    {"parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "=https://graph.facebook.com/v21.0/{{$json.tokens.FB_ID}}/photos", "sendBody": true, "specifyBody": "json", "jsonBody": "={ \"url\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.ImageURL) }}, \"caption\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.Caption) }}, \"access_token\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.tokens.MetaToken) }} }", "options": {"response": {"response": {"neverError": true}}}}, "id": "p9", "name": "P9 FB ⑪⑫", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [900, 380]},
    {"parameters": {"method": "POST", "url": "https://api.pinterest.com/v5/pins", "sendHeaders": true, "headerParameters": {"parameters": [{"name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{$json.tokens.PinToken}}"}]}, "sendBody": true, "specifyBody": "json", "jsonBody": "={ \"board_id\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.tokens.PinBoard) }}, \"title\": {{ JSON.stringify(($json.Caption||'').slice(0,90)) }}, \"media_source\": { \"source_type\": \"image_url\", \"url\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.ImageURL) }} } }", "options": {"response": {"response": {"neverError": true}}}}, "id": "p10", "name": "P10 Pinterest ⑬⑭", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest", "typeVersion": 4.2, "position": [900, 500]},
    {"parameters": {"operation": "sendPhoto", "chatId": "={{$json.tokens.TgChannel}}", "photo": "={{$json.ImageURL}}", "additionalFields": {"caption": "={{$json.Caption}}"}}, "id": "p11", "name": "P11 Tg channel ⑮⑯", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram", "typeVersion": 1.2, "position": [900, 620], "credentials": {"telegramApi": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Ospyr Bot"}}},
    {"parameters": {"operation": "sendMessage", "chatId": "={{$env.TG_OSPYR_CHAT}}", "text": "={{ $json._hygiene ? '🧹 QUEUE HYGIENE: '+$json._hygiene : '✅ Published for '+$json.Client+' → mark row Done ('+$json.ImageURL+')' }}", "additionalFields": {}}, "id": "p12", "name": "P12 recap+hygiene ㉔㉖", "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram", "typeVersion": 1.2, "position": [1260, 460], "credentials": {"telegramApi": {"id": "REPLACE", "name": "Ospyr Bot"}}}
  ],
